sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager as Manager / Learning Lead
    participant Copilot as Microsoft 365 Copilot Experience
    participant Agent as SkillForge Copilot Agent
    participant Topic as Conversation Topic
    participant Knowledge as Synthetic Knowledge Sources
    participant Boundary as Responsible AI Boundary
    participant Output as Manager-Ready Output

    Manager->>Copilot: Ask readiness question
    Copilot->>Agent: Route request to enterprise agent
    Agent->>Topic: Match supported conversation flow
    Topic->>Knowledge: Retrieve approved synthetic context
    Knowledge-->>Agent: Return readiness facts and policy context
    Agent->>Boundary: Apply advisory-only and human review rules
    Boundary-->>Agent: Confirm safe response framing
    Agent->>Output: Generate grounded answer
    Output-->>Manager: Return summary, briefing or follow-up draft
